# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps host artefacts out
# of the image. A stale backend/target or frontend/node_modules copied in from
# the host is how a build starts passing locally and failing on the platform for
# reasons nobody can reproduce.

.git
.github
.claude
docs
postman
scripts
docker

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.venv
**/__pycache__

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
